-LOG MixedMatchTest3
-STATEMENT MATCH (a:person) OPTIONAL MATCH (a)-[:knows]->(b:person) WHERE b.fName='Farooq' MATCH (b)<-[:knows]-(c:person) RETURN COUNT(*)
