24

-LOG MixedMatchHashJoinTest
-STATEMENT MATCH (a:person)-[:knows]->(b:person) OPTIONAL MATCH (b)-[:knows]->(c:person) MATCH (c)-[:knows]->(d:person)-[:knows]->(e:person) RETURN COUNT(*)
---- 1
324

-LOG OptionalReadStringPropertyTest
